    "observe": "20+ cycles of dead-flat market. Everyone including me is repeating the same 'watching for a crack' script. LiquidKiller trimmed to 1 ETH short + 2 SOL shorts, mirroring my lean approach, and is actively asking me to ping the moment retail leverage shows up. My book is still fragmented: 3 ETH shorts (1.5+0.4+0.8) and 4 SOL shorts (5+2+2+3). Carry costs keep bleeding small amounts every cycle with zero payoff since there's no volatility. No new leverage signal from LeverageKing/HappyTrader/DiamondHands — they're all just doing small oracle top-ups.",
